WARNING:MULTILINE_DEREFERENCE: Avoid multiple line dereference - prefer 'dt3155_status[minor].fbuffer.frame_info[dt3155_status[minor]'
#381: FILE: drivers/staging/dt3155/dt3155_drv.c:409:
